diff --git a/content/agm-2026.md b/content/agm-2026.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..e750b86b67aa7df96e9605fc6099fcfe0f120b85
--- /dev/null
+++ b/content/agm-2026.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+title: 2026 Annual General Meeting
+layout: agm
+url: /agm/2026/
+---
+
+- Date: Saturday, December 12, 2026
+- Time: 2:00pm
+- Location: Burnaby Public Library, Tommy Douglas Branch
+- Address: 7311 Kingsway, Burnaby BC
+
+[Download the AGM package (PDF)](/files/vanlug-agm-2026-package.pdf).
+
+There is no electronic attendance and no proxy voting. You must attend in person to vote.
